OL,3,GNEWSACotswold village may get
OL,4,Aresidents' parking scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA residents' parking scheme could be
OL,7,Fintroduced in a Cotswold village
OL,8,Fpopular with visitors.
OL,10,FCastle Combe in Wiltshire, previously
OL,11,Fnamed one of the "prettiest villages in
OL,12,FEngland", can be packed with tourists,
OL,13,Fespecially at the weekends and on bank
OL,14,Fholidays.
OL,16,FFamous for being the backdrop to films
OL,17,Flike Stardust and War Horse, people
OL,18,Fflock to the village's bridge over the
OL,19,FRiver Bybrook which offers a stunning
OL,20,Fbackdrop to photos.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
