OL,3,GNEWSACotswold village may get
OL,4,Aresidents' parking scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut people who call Castle Combe home
OL,7,Fsay the parking situation can become
OL,8,F"unpleasant" when visitors block
OL,9,Fdriveways or park illegally, which
OL,10,Fmakes already narrow roads harder to
OL,11,Fnavigate.
